1
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:23,800
I told you to stop!

2
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:25,400
Ow!

3
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:26,440
You lousy husband!

4
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:29,600
-You stole my money for booze again?
-I give up!

5
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:30,560
Please don't hit me.

6
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:31,840
Hey! Stop!

7
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,520
Hold on.

8
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:35,320
Where are you going?

9
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,480
Help me!

10
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:38,640
No! Ow! Honey!

11
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:39,760
Didn't I tell you?

12
00:01:40,440 --> 00:01:42,160
I told you not to take my money.

13
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:44,080
-Help me! Please help!
-Uncle.

14
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:45,000
Hey! Stop!

15
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,800
Easy, Hom Thong.

16
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,400
-Please, let's just talk this out.
-Help me.

17
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:51,000
Calm down, Hom Thong.

18
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,480
-Hey, calm down.
-Uncle!

19
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:55,120
-Uncle, help me out!
-Let's talk this out.

20
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:58,880
Stop fighting.
His head's bleeding. Get him to a doctor.

21
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:00,160
No, please…

22
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:01,800
You never learn, do you?

23
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,640
-Hey, put that down.
-Go home!

24
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:05,960
Get him to a doctor first.

25
00:02:06,040 --> 00:02:07,240
Come here!

26
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:10,479
Huh?

27
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,160
Where's Hom Thong?

28
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,320
Hom Thong!

29
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:18,040
Hom Thong!

30
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,920
-Hom Thong!
-Hom Thong!

31
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:24,000
-Hom Thong!
-Hom Thong!

32
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,120
Where did Hom Thong go?

33
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,040
His hoofprints lead this way.

34
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:35,480
Hom Thong!

35
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,880
-Hom Thong!
-Hom Thong!

36
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,000
Hey!

37
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,000
Hom Thong!

38
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:45,080
Hom Thong!

39
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,680
Why are you wandering around drunk?

40
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,200
Is he related to you?

41
00:02:50,960 --> 00:02:51,800
No.

42
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:55,320
We'd better split up and find Hom Thong.

43
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,440
I'll go that way.

44
00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,440
Hey! Get up!

45
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,960
-How many would you like?
-Two sets.

46
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,960
-Sauce on the side, please.
-Sure.

47
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:07,880
BUFFALO MILK YOGURT

48
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,560
-Sa-Ang.
-Huh?

49
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:14,880
-Has Phuyai Dech called?
-Ugh!

50
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:18,240
Neither Dech nor Din has said a word.

51
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:21,360
-I've been checking my phone all day.
-Mom!

52
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:24,240
Mom, has Dad sorted things out yet?

53
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:26,960
You're asking the same thing as your aunt.

54
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:29,200
Both your dad and your brother

55
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:32,480
have gone completely silent.
Neither one's answering me.

56
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,680
Then I'll message Din myself.

57
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:37,480
I overheard Rut and Ming talking.

58
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:39,840
-They were meeting Sia Aun for business.
-Really?

59
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:41,960
-Ask him. Go on.
-Ask him.

60
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:48,720
HAVE YOU GOTTEN THE DNA SAMPLES
FROM SIA AUN AND HIS MEN YET?

61
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:05,480
-Din hasn't even read my message, Mom.
-Ugh!

62
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,520
Come on!

63
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:08,280
-I'll call Dech myself.
-Go ahead.

64
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,920
How's it going?

65
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,560
I'm busy, honey. I'll call you back. Bye.

66
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:21,440
Wait…

67
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:22,360
What?

68
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,960
-He hung up.
-No way.

69
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:29,080
-I didn't even get to say anything.
-Yeah, you didn't even get to ask.

70
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:33,160
Din still hasn't read my message.

71
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:36,040
Thanks so much
for having lunch with me today.

72
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,880
Sorry I can't stay any longer.

73
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,680
I've got another business meeting.

74
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:44,400
I'll leave my men in your care.

75
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,640
Of course, boss.

76
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:47,680
I'll take good care of them.

77
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,640
-Thanks a lot.
-You're welcome.

78
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:50,840
-Goodbye.
-Goodbye.

79
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,840
-Goodbye, boss.
-Goodbye.

80
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,800
Goodbye, boss.

81
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,720
Goodbye.

82
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,560
Thank you.

83
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,160
Hey! He's calling.

84
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,120
How did it go? Did you get them?

85
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:23,360
Only samples from his men.

86
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:26,040
Sia Aun and Khwanchai
wouldn't touch their glasses.

87
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:32,200
If we can't get samples
from Sia Aun and Khwanchai,

88
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:34,080
what are we going to do?

89
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,600
-Orn.
-Huh?

90
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,520
Watch the stall for me.

91
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:46,560
-Mom, where are you going?
-Where are you going?

92
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,760
Mom, let's go.

93
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:49,800
-Look after the stall, sweetie.
-Auntie, wait for me!

94
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:51,040
Oh my goodness.

95
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,160
Here, take it.

96
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:11,160
What now?

97
00:06:12,040 --> 00:06:12,920
Hello, Ob.

98
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,400
Hey, Auem.

99
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:16,200
Hom Thong isn't at the pond.

100
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,640
He's not by the big tree either.

101
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:25,240
Have you checked the security camera
at the pen again?

102
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:27,040
Maybe Hom Thong went home.

103
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:28,880
Hang on.

104
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:37,520
He's still not back, Ob.

105
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,040
I've got an idea.

106
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,200
Hom Thong!

107
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:53,920
BOONYOD THADAMIT

108
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:58,480
Ugh.

109
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,680
Hom Thong.

110
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:05,200
I was worried sick about you.

111
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,920
So you came to see Dad.

112
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:21,800
BOONYOD THADAMIT

113
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:29,880
Well, how do I look today?

114
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:33,280
You look amazing, as always.

115
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:36,560
-You're the coolest.
-Such a sweet talker.

116
00:07:36,640 --> 00:07:38,280
We have to close this deal today.

117
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:49,800
-Hello, Sia Aun.
-Hello.

118
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:50,720
Hello.

119
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,280
-Please, have a seat.
-Hello.

120
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,320
Have a seat.

121
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:57,000
Hello, Sia Aun.

122
00:07:57,080 --> 00:08:00,800
My father said you're interested
in making buffalo growth supplements.

123
00:08:01,400 --> 00:08:02,280
That's right.

124
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:07,800
But I want mine to stand out
from what's already on the market.

125
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:11,240
I want to add

126
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,680
deep-sea red algae.

127
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,760
We can certainly do that.

128
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:21,040
But importing that algae
would be very expensive.

129
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:25,840
There are much cheaper alternatives
that work just as well.

130
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,440
I've brought the details.

131
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:29,240
-Yes, I know.
-Please take a look.

132
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:32,280
I know there are alternatives.

133
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,200
But

134
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:38,440
I just want everyone to believe
this supplement

135
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:42,080
contains red algae.

136
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:47,200
We don't actually have to put any in.

137
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,200
Can you do that for me?

138
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:01,960
Of course, Sia Aun.
No problem. I'll take care of it.

139
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:03,760
Easy enough.

140
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,200
Okay, sure.

141
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:16,480
Mom, Dad and Din have collected
their DNA samples.

142
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:19,600
They're on their way here,
and they said you and Aunt Sa-Ing

143
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,480
mustn't do anything.

144
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,680
You're planning something,
aren't you, Sa-Ing?

145
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:29,560
Don't even think about it. It's dangerous.

146
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:33,480
Exactly. If they find out
we're collecting DNA samples,

147
00:09:33,560 --> 00:09:34,920
our cover will be blown.

148
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:37,000
Fine. I won't do anything.

149
00:09:37,680 --> 00:09:40,760
-Unless your husband takes too long.
-Oh, come on!

150
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:56,160
Thank you so much, Sia Aun.
I really appreciate it.

151
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,360
Thank you.

152
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:59,120
It's a pleasure doing business with you.

153
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,040
-Thanks.
-Thank you.

154
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,960
-Thank you.
-Goodbye.

155
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:05,520
Sia Aun's about to leave.

156
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,880
Hurry! Call your dad!

157
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:09,640
Just a second.

158
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:13,720
-Hurry up!
-No one's answering, Mom.

159
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,760
-Hey! Sa-Ing!
-Huh?

160
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,000
-Oh my goodness.
-Mom!

161
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:29,160
-Hey!
-What the hell?

162
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:31,080
What are you doing? Hey!

163
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:33,320
-Auntie!
-How can you call yourself a grown man?

164
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,080
What are you talking about?

165
00:10:35,160 --> 00:10:36,560
My daughter told me everything.

166
00:10:36,640 --> 00:10:39,120
You lied about Hom Thong being dead
and hid him away.

167
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,960
You kept him and even beat him!

168
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:42,120
And then there's--

169
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,360
-Auntie!
-Sa-Ing!

170
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,080
Why are you stopping me?

171
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:48,440
He deserves it!

172
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,920
Whoa, Mom!

173
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:53,040
-Please stop! Don't, Mom!
-Who are you calling Mom?

174
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:56,280
And you! You're just as bad.

175
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:58,360
Pretending to love Auem.

176
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,640
You cozied up to me and Yod.

177
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:02,080
Once you found out we were in debt,

178
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:05,040
you dumped Auem
and went off with another woman.

179
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:07,280
-He has the right to choose, Auntie.
-Auntie?

180
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:10,800
Let's go, Boss.
Don't waste your time on these people.

181
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:13,040
Wait, Sa-Ing!

182
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,520
-Auntie!
-Let go!

183
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:16,000
-Let go!
-Let go of him!

184
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,680
-Let go!
-Hey!

185
00:11:20,880 --> 00:11:21,800
Did you just push my aunt?

186
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:24,720
-Ow! My back!
-How dare you?

187
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:26,280
-How dare you?
-What the hell?

188
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:30,400
You people are asking for trouble,
aren't you?

189
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,360
-Hey, what are you doing?
-Don't, Auntie!

190
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:35,680
Hey! Call the police.

191
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:38,680
-I'll press charges against them all.
-Yes, Boss.

192
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,720
Hom Thong!

193
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:01,720
There you are.

194
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,640
I've been looking for you.

195
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:08,440
At first, I couldn't figure out
where Hom Thong might've gone.

196
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:10,320
So I thought I'd try looking here.

197
00:12:10,400 --> 00:12:11,680
And sure enough, there he was.

198
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,840
Hom Thong must miss Yod too.

199
00:12:23,680 --> 00:12:25,360
Come on, Hom Thong.

200
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,600
Let's go home.

201
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:31,080
Don't be scared.
No one's going to hurt you anymore.

202
00:12:40,880 --> 00:12:42,800
Hello, Din. How did it go?

203
00:12:44,520 --> 00:12:46,360
What? Which police station?

204
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,680
Okay, I'll be right there.

205
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:56,520
I'm not letting this slide.

206
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:58,280
I was just minding my own business.

207
00:12:58,360 --> 00:13:01,120
These people came after me.
I don't know what their problem is!

208
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:02,160
What?

209
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,160
Listen!

210
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:06,560
There's nothing wrong with me.
You're the one picking on my daughter!

211
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,080
See that, Officer?

212
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:11,440
They're the ones who started it.

213
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,120
-Auem.
-Mom.

214
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:20,320
What's going on?
How did you end up fighting with Sia Aun?

215
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,480
Good, you're here.

216
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,680
You'd better have their bail money ready.

217
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:26,520
I'll make sure they all end up in jail.

218
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,360
Fine.

219
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,800
If you press charges against my mom,

220
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,800
I'll do the same to you

221
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:35,680
for breaking the agreement
to sell us Hom Thong

222
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:38,640
and faking evidence that he was dead

223
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,360
so you could sell him to someone else.

224
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:45,840
Well?

225
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:47,720
Willing to take that risk?

226
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:54,080
BOONYOD FARM

227
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:59,640
Auntie, give me a heads-up
about your plan next time

228
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,360
so I can be prepared.

229
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:02,840
There won't be a next time.

230
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:06,440
Mom, Auntie, and Rung.

231
00:14:06,520 --> 00:14:08,320
Don't ever do that again.

232
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:10,600
How could you pick a fight with Sia Aun?
It's dangerous.

233
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:13,320
Hey! If I hadn't done that,

234
00:14:13,400 --> 00:14:15,520
we wouldn't have gotten
DNA samples from Sia Aun

235
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,960
and Khwanchai.

236
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:19,200
-Exactly.
-Look! See?

237
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:22,440
Totally worth it.

238
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:27,040
SIA AUN, KHWANCHAI

239
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:30,600
But what if Sia Aun had caught you?
Would it still be worth it, Mom?

240
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,480
Well, do I look hurt?

241
00:14:32,560 --> 00:14:34,920
I'm still in one piece!

242
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,920
And I got to yank his hair
to get even for you.

243
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:42,120
Oh, and what about your side?

244
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,800
-Did you get them all?
-Yeah.

245
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:45,520
We got them all, Mom.

246
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:46,800
-Wow.
-Wow.

247
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,440
Great.

248
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:50,560
We should get them tested right away.

249
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:52,280
Then we'll finally know

250
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:55,680
if Sia Aun and his men stole the buffaloes
the day Yod was hit by a car.

251
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:58,680
Well, as for that,

252
00:14:58,760 --> 00:15:02,240
I'll take care of it.
But it'll take some time, Auem.

253
00:15:03,160 --> 00:15:04,320
Okay.

254
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:06,080
Everyone, be careful in the meantime.

255
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:09,200
Sia Aun won't let you get away
with pulling his hair.

256
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:25,160
-Auem.
-Yes?

257
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:26,880
Lift Hom Thong's head a little.

258
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:30,600
There. Perfect.

259
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:32,680
Wow! Looking handsome, Hom Thong!

260
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:36,920
Let's get a side shot now.

261
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,520
-Come here.
-Good!

262
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:42,880
-Ob.
-Yes?

263
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,800
Bring Hom Ngern over
for a photo with Hom Thong.

264
