491
00:29:30,320 --> 00:29:32,600
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Why would I ever make trouble for them?</font></font></i>

492
00:29:32,680 --> 00:29:37,160
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">When Auem's family</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">ran into financial trouble,</font></font></i>

493
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:40,160
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">I helped by buying Hom Thong</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">and looking after him.</font></font></i>

494
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:45,520
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Now Auem has managed to raise</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">enough money to buy him back,</font></font></i>

495
00:29:45,600 --> 00:29:48,040
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">and I'm happy to return him.</font></font></i>

496
00:29:48,720 --> 00:29:50,440
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">After everything I've done,</font></font></i>

497
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:53,400
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">why would I want to hurt her?</font></font></i>

498
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:58,800
Sia Aun's playing the hero now.
I can't stand him!

499
00:29:58,880 --> 00:30:02,160
I'd also like to speak up and confirm

500
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:07,160
that Dan Dao Farm's semen is high quality
and they're not scamming anyone.

501
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:10,800
Both our farms have fallen victim
to a third party

502
00:30:10,880 --> 00:30:14,120
who tried to turn us against each other.

503
00:30:15,000 --> 00:30:18,240
As someone who's been
in the show buffalo industry for years,

504
00:30:19,000 --> 00:30:22,520
I want smaller buffalo farms
to have a place in this industry.

505
00:30:23,120 --> 00:30:25,000
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">And in the future,</font></font></i>

506
00:30:25,080 --> 00:30:28,880
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">our show buffaloes could become</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">a source of soft power for our country.</font></font></i>

507
00:30:29,600 --> 00:30:30,760
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Thank you very much.</font></font></i>

508
00:30:37,080 --> 00:30:40,240
Can I comment
and tell everyone Sia Aun's lying?

509
00:30:40,320 --> 00:30:41,960
-Hey, wait!
-Hold on, Ob.

510
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:44,920
Leave it alone, or this will never end.

511
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:48,000
Exactly. I think it's best
we stay out of each other's way.

512
00:30:48,520 --> 00:30:52,280
He's already paying
for trying to discredit our buffalo.

513
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:55,040
How about this?

514
00:30:55,920 --> 00:30:59,280
Let's focus on restoring
our farm's reputation.

515
00:30:59,880 --> 00:31:03,240
We'll show everyone just how healthy

516
00:31:03,320 --> 00:31:05,160
and high-quality Phet Kla's semen is.

517
00:31:20,320 --> 00:31:24,320
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Today, we're getting Hom Ngern ready</font></font></i>
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">to breed with Phet Kla.</font></font></i>

518
00:31:24,400 --> 00:31:27,880
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">She's already waiting in the pen.</font></font></i>

519
00:31:27,960 --> 00:31:31,600
Once Hom Ngern is in heat
and ready to breed with Phet Kla,

520
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:34,000
I'll post another video to update you

521
00:31:34,080 --> 00:31:38,440
and prove there's nothing wrong
with Phet Kla's semen.

522
00:31:38,520 --> 00:31:40,680
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">And then, 11 months later,</font></font></i>

523
00:31:40,760 --> 00:31:42,920
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">we'll get to see their calf.</font></font></i>

524
00:31:47,720 --> 00:31:48,920
All done.

525
00:31:50,200 --> 00:31:53,920
Judging by the signs, she should be ready
to breed in two or three days.

526
00:31:58,920 --> 00:32:01,720
Make sure you check on her regularly
over the next few days.

527
00:32:01,800 --> 00:32:02,680
Sure, Uncle.

528
00:32:07,320 --> 00:32:08,320
Just a little longer, okay?

529
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:25,200
What's wrong, Uncle?

530
00:32:25,280 --> 00:32:27,400
Someone's gone into Por Chang's pen.

531
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:34,920
Por Chang.

532
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:46,040
Hello. You're at my house?

533
00:32:49,760 --> 00:32:50,600
Hey.

534
00:32:53,560 --> 00:32:55,560
-I need to head back to Uthai Thani.
-Huh?

535
00:32:56,160 --> 00:32:57,240
Uncle.

536
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:18,840
Nuan.

537
00:33:20,240 --> 00:33:23,360
Why is your fridge so empty?
All you've got are eggs.

538
00:33:23,440 --> 00:33:26,160
And where have you been?
You're always with Por Chang.

539
00:33:30,440 --> 00:33:32,280
What about you?
What are you doing at my house?

540
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,720
And what's all that stuff?

541
00:33:39,000 --> 00:33:42,080
Well, I was thinking
I'd stay with you for a while.

542
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:43,000
What?

543
00:33:43,600 --> 00:33:46,280
What about your job at the hospital?

544
00:33:47,560 --> 00:33:49,440
-I got laid off.
-Huh?

545
00:33:49,520 --> 00:33:50,520
So,

546
00:33:51,720 --> 00:33:54,480
I thought I'd take a short break
before looking for a new job.

547
00:33:54,560 --> 00:33:56,440
You? Staying at my house?

548
00:33:56,520 --> 00:34:00,800
Last time you were here, you complained
about the buffalo dung and the heat.

549
00:34:00,880 --> 00:34:02,040
How can you stand it?

550
00:34:05,040 --> 00:34:08,320
Are you just making excuses
because you don't want me here?

551
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:10,960
No, I'm just asking.

552
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:18,360
Take my bags inside too.

553
00:34:29,280 --> 00:34:33,040
You can have the same room as last time.
I'll get the sheets ready.

554
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:34,760
Thanks.

555
00:34:55,760 --> 00:34:56,600
Hello.

556
00:34:57,920 --> 00:34:59,040
I'm not running away.

557
00:35:00,080 --> 00:35:01,880
I'm staying with my brother
in Uthai Thani.

558
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:05,240
I'm here to get the money to pay you back.

559
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:08,280
You'll get your money.

560
00:35:10,040 --> 00:35:11,440
My brother owns some land.

561
00:35:12,240 --> 00:35:15,800
I'll convince him to sell it
and use the money to pay you back.

562
00:35:17,240 --> 00:35:18,080
Bye.

563
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:43,040
Let's get you cleaned up, Por Chang,
for your photoshoot for our page.

564
00:35:51,680 --> 00:35:53,040
Come on!

565
00:35:53,120 --> 00:35:54,960
Turn that music down! I'm trying to sleep!

566
00:35:55,680 --> 00:35:56,840
Hey!

567
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:58,680
Who are you? What are you doing
at my brother's house?

568
00:35:59,360 --> 00:36:02,560
And why are you messing with his buffalo?
Get out! All of you!

569
00:36:02,640 --> 00:36:04,200
Tik! Where are you?

570
00:36:04,280 --> 00:36:05,520
-Tik!
-Nuan!

571
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:07,440
-Tik!
-You're the one who should stop yelling!

572
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:09,920
I know all these kids.

573
00:36:11,200 --> 00:36:13,160
Hello, ma'am.

574
00:36:13,240 --> 00:36:16,040
You're Aunt Nuan, right? Well…

575
00:36:16,120 --> 00:36:19,040
I'm Auemdao, and this is Dindaen.

576
00:36:19,120 --> 00:36:21,080
That's my younger brother, Ob.

577
00:36:21,160 --> 00:36:23,040
We're partners in a buffalo farm.

578
00:36:23,560 --> 00:36:25,240
Partners? Tik!

579
00:36:26,040 --> 00:36:27,880
Since when did you partner
with these kids?

580
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:29,560
Why do you need to know?

581
00:36:29,640 --> 00:36:32,520
What's wrong with wanting to know?

582
00:36:32,600 --> 00:36:34,680
You've never run a business.

583
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:36,760
You've never wanted to run a farm either.

584
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:38,640
You always kept to yourself,
so what's this?

585
00:36:38,720 --> 00:36:40,840
How do you know these kids
aren't scamming you?

586
00:36:41,440 --> 00:36:43,120
Whoa, nobody's scamming me.

587
00:36:43,640 --> 00:36:46,080
Don't worry about it. Go get ready to eat.

588
00:36:47,880 --> 00:36:49,960
Ob, keep washing Por Chang.

589
00:36:50,640 --> 00:36:51,720
Then we can take his photos.

590
00:36:52,920 --> 00:36:53,760
Okay.

591
00:36:55,080 --> 00:36:56,080
Let's make you look handsome.

592
00:37:08,240 --> 00:37:10,800
Come on, tell me about the farm.

593
00:37:12,760 --> 00:37:13,760
Nuan.

594
00:37:15,880 --> 00:37:20,360
Tik, I'm your older sister.
I have the right to know.

595
00:37:22,240 --> 00:37:23,800
It's okay, Uncle. I'll explain.

596
00:37:25,640 --> 00:37:28,840
Din and I started a buffalo farm together.

597
00:37:28,920 --> 00:37:30,680
It's called Dan Dao Buffalo Farm.

598
00:37:30,760 --> 00:37:35,000
We each have two buffaloes.
Then, when we met Uncle Tik,

599
00:37:35,080 --> 00:37:38,440
I invited him to bring Por Chang
to our farm.

600
00:37:40,160 --> 00:37:42,280
And how do you split the profits?

601
00:37:44,560 --> 00:37:46,040
We split everything equally.

602
00:37:47,520 --> 00:37:49,680
Which buffalo earns the most?

603
00:37:49,760 --> 00:37:51,320
Why do you want to know?

604
00:37:51,400 --> 00:37:53,680
You've never cared about buffaloes before.

605
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:56,760
Tik, you just keep quiet!

606
00:37:56,840 --> 00:37:57,680
Ugh!

607
00:37:58,520 --> 00:38:00,800
Tell me, dear. Which one earns the most?

608
00:38:01,760 --> 00:38:04,400
Well, Por Chang, of course.

609
00:38:04,480 --> 00:38:07,160
He's a giant albino buffalo.

610
00:38:07,760 --> 00:38:09,880
Some people pay 50,000 baht
just to hire him.

611
00:38:10,680 --> 00:38:12,240
Fifty thousand baht?

612
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:15,960
Does he get hired often?

613
00:38:19,080 --> 00:38:21,560
You guys are done eating, right?

614
00:38:21,640 --> 00:38:24,080
Let's clear the dishes
and go take photos of Por Chang.

615
00:38:24,160 --> 00:38:25,240
-Come on.
-Tik!

616
00:38:25,880 --> 00:38:28,240
You don't want me to know
anything about the money?

617
00:38:28,320 --> 00:38:30,440
Why are you grilling them?

618
00:38:30,520 --> 00:38:33,520
I'm worried you're getting
the short end of the stick.

619
00:38:33,600 --> 00:38:36,320
Por Chang earns the most,

620
00:38:36,400 --> 00:38:38,640
so he should get a bigger share.

621
00:38:40,480 --> 00:38:43,240
We can discuss
the profit split another day.

622
00:38:43,320 --> 00:38:45,880
You can't just split it
equally three ways.

623
00:38:47,760 --> 00:38:49,080
There's no need, Auem.

624
00:38:51,280 --> 00:38:54,280
Nuan, Chang is my buffalo.

625
00:38:54,360 --> 00:38:56,480
How much I get paid is my business.

626
00:38:57,960 --> 00:38:58,920
Come on, guys.

627
00:39:05,600 --> 00:39:06,440
Jeez.

628
00:39:13,280 --> 00:39:14,760
Hey, watch out.

629
00:39:22,560 --> 00:39:25,240
I forgot the coconut oil
for polishing Por Chang's horns.

630
00:39:25,320 --> 00:39:28,160
-You go ahead without me.
-It's okay, Uncle. I'll get it.

631
00:39:28,240 --> 00:39:29,320
-Okay.
-Go on ahead.

632
00:39:31,640 --> 00:39:32,480
-Come on.
-Let's go.

633
00:39:33,600 --> 00:39:35,720
Come on, boy. Time for your photoshoot.

634
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:02,600
He won't let me get involved
with the buffaloes.

635
00:40:03,240 --> 00:40:05,120
And I can't even find the land title deed.

636
00:40:33,280 --> 00:40:35,720
Ah! What are you doing?

637
00:42:12,320 --> 00:42:14,120
Subtitle translation by:
Chomchanach Yanaharn
